    "longDescription": "The app is designed for engineers and system administrators who need a fast and convenient way to connect to their servers from iPhone, iPad, and Mac — wherever they are.\n\nKey features:\nImport configurations via links or subscriptions\nAutomatic server list updates from your own sources\nReal-time connection quality monitoring\nDetailed traffic usage statistics\nNative interface optimized for the entire Apple ecosystem\n\nImportant: INCY does not provide servers or network services.\nThe app works exclusively with your existing infrastructure — you have full control over where and how you connect.",
